---
const { compact = false } = Astro.props;
---

<div class="split-grid">
  <div class="portrait-stack" aria-label="Wedding portraits">
    <img src="/images/IMG_5933.JPG" alt="Kieran and Nang on their wedding day" loading="lazy" />
    <img src="/images/IMG_3465.jpg" alt="A candid wedding day moment" loading="lazy" />
  </div>
  <div class="copy-block">
    <p class="eyebrow">The beginning of this chapter</p>
    <h1>{compact ? "From DePaul dorms to forever." : "From friends to family."}</h1>
    <p>
      We met in 2018 in the DePaul dorms, Beldine Racine Hall to be exact.
      We started talking as friends, the way the best things sometimes begin:
      casually, honestly, without knowing how much a person is about to matter.
    </p>
    <p>
      Some of the earliest memories still feel perfectly us. Kieran falling
      asleep on Nang's mattress topper while she was studying for finals. Nang
      getting her first tattoo and wanting to show him first.
    </p>
    <p>
      Our first date was the Art Institute of Chicago and sushi at Hot Woks Cool
      Sushi next to the museum. On the walk there, someone from Kraft was handing
      out free mac and cheese, which feels like the kind of strange, perfect
      Chicago detail a story should keep forever.
    </p>
    {!compact && (
      <p>
        We still have pieces of that day: the museum program, the ticket on
        Nang's cork board, and the memory of walking through the miniature rooms
        exhibit telling each other which tiny rooms we wanted to live in.
      </p>
    )}
    <div class="memory-list" aria-label="Wedding day highlights">
      <article class="memory">
        <strong>2018</strong>
        <p>Friends first in Beldine Racine Hall.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="memory">
        <strong>First date</strong>
        <p>Art Institute, miniature rooms, sushi, and surprise mac and cheese.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="memory">
        <strong>Wedding day</strong>
        <p>Daley Center, Amazon rings, borrowed cash, and our people.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
